{% extends "./_layout.njk" %}

{% block guidanceContent %}
<p class="govuk-body">You can update a person’s details in MPOP using the online check ins page in their case file.</p>
<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Updating contact details or preferred contact method</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">You can view and change a person’s contact details in MPOP. This allows you to change their mobile number or email address, and the contact method they’d like to use to get their check in links.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">If you change contact details in MPOP, this will update the contact details in NDelius.</p>
{# <h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Changing the person’s photo</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">You can choose to update a photo of someone, for example, if their appearance has changed or the photo on the system isn’t clear. Go to the online check ins page in MPOP for the person and there will be an option to change the photo.</p>
<p class="govuk-body">From there you can follow the same process you used to sign the person up, to either take or upload a photo of them.</p> #}
<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Changing check in frequency or date</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">You can choose a new check in date and frequency in MPOP. This allows you to:</p>
<ul class="govuk-list govuk-list--bullet">
  <li>change from recurring check ins to scheduling one at a time</li>
  <li>change from one at a time to recurring check ins</li>
  <li>change the date that you want the person to check in</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="govuk-heading-m">Changing the sentence online check ins is linked with</h3>
<p class="govuk-body">When you sign someone up to use online check ins who has multiple active sentences, you’ll need to choose which sentence to link online check ins with. If you need to change this after sign up, you can choose a new sentence in the online check ins page for that person in MPOP.</p>
{% endblock %}
